<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Serviço de Buffet - Chicas Café</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css" integrity="sha512-SnH5WK+bZxgPHs44uWIX+LLJAJ9/2PkPKZ5QiAj6Ta86w+fsb2TkcmfRyVX3pBnMFcV7oQPJkl9QevSCWr3W6A==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
</head>
<body>
    <main class="container">
        <section class="service-page">
            <p class="section-subtitle">Serviços</p>
            <h1>Buffet</h1>
            <p>Cardápios sob medida para cada ocasião: coquetéis, coffee break, brunch e refeições completas. Clique nos cartões para ver os detalhes.</p>
            <a href="#" class="main-cta-button">Ver pacotes</a>

            <div class="service-grid">
                <div class="service-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570729706343-6880a5a3061a?w=500" alt="Coquetéis" class="bg-image">
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="service-card-content">
                        <h3>Coquetéis</h3>
                        <p>Serviço para criar sinergia</p>
                        <a href="#">Ver detalhes</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559305417-7d2a2223a3a4?w=500" alt="Coffee Break" class="bg-image">
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="service-card-content">
                        <h3>Coffee Break</h3>
                        <p>Forte para marcar a memória</p>
                        <a href="#">Ver detalhes</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585698378729-37e4a414e5b3?w=500" alt="Brunch" class="bg-image">
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="service-card-content">
                        <h3>Brunch</h3>
                        <p>Visão de cima do seu evento</p>
                        <a href="#">Ver detalhes</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543353071-873f6b6e6a89?w=500" alt="Almoço/Jantar" class="bg-image">
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="service-card-content">
                        <h3>Almoço/Jantar</h3>
                        <p>Selfie com a gente por perto</p>
                        <a href="#">Ver detalhes</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621939514649-280e2ee25f61?w=500" alt="Sobremesas & Doces" class="bg-image">
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="service-card-content">
                        <h3>Sobremesas & Doces</h3>
                        <p>Transmissão dos melhores lances</p>
                        <a href="#">Ver detalhes</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514362545857-3bc96c4cc7a1?w=500" alt="Bebidas & Bar" class="bg-image">
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="service-card-content">
                        <h3>Bebidas & Bar</h3>
                        <p>TV e mais equipamentos</p>
                        <a href="#">Ver detalhes</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>